{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 12:42-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.AUTO-LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["da"],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Hvis v\u00e6rdien er valgt, skal du blot begynde at skrive en ny v\u00e6rdi for at slette den tidligere v\u00e6rdi."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["N\u00e5r et tal er valgt (v\u00e6rdien vises omvendt), kan du bruge h\u00f8jre piletast til at slette valget uden at slette v\u00e6rdien. Brug derefter backspace for at redigere."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["TIP: Generelt er det bedst at bruge TAB- eller SHIFT-TAB-tasterne til at g\u00e5 fra en indtastning til den n\u00e6ste eller forrige indtastning."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["TIP 2: Generelt er det ineffektivt at redigere en v\u00e6rdi. Da v\u00e6rdier er automatisk valgte, skal du blot skrive det \u00f8nskede tal."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Du m\u00e5 ikke skrive tusindseparatoren."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Hvis der anvendes amerikansk konvention, ville det v\u00e6re kommaet.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Jeg er smart nok til at indtaste dem for dig!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Der er opst\u00e5et en ukendt fejl i beregningen af en dato."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Giv os venligst dine input og indstillinger, s\u00e5 vi kan l\u00f8se dette problem. Tak."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Datoen er ikke gyldig - d\u00e5rligt \u00e5rstal."],"Jan":["Jan"],"Feb":["Feb"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Maj"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sep"],"Oct":["Okt"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["dec."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Fejl: datoer i forkert r\u00e6kkef\u00f8lge."],"Exception":["Undtagelse"],"occurred when accessing":["opstod ved adgang til"],"Invalid index":["Ugyldigt indeks"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Intern gr\u00e6nse er n\u00e5et. Saldoen overstiger +\/- 99 billioner."],"YTD":["\u00c5TD"],"Running Totals":["L\u00f8bende totaler"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Din personlige l\u00e5neplan"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Sidste betalingsbel\u00f8b er faldet med"],"due to rounding":["p\u00e5 grund af afrunding"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Sidste betalingsbel\u00f8b forh\u00f8jet med"],"Auto Loan Summary":["Bill\u00e5nsresum\u00e9"],"Down Payment":["Udbetaling"],"Loan Amount":["L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b"],"Number of Payments":["Antal betalinger"],"Annual Interest Rate":["\u00c5rlig rentesats"],"Periodic Payment":["Periodisk afdrag"],"Loan Date":["Udl\u00e5nsdato"],"1st Payment Due":["1. betaling forfalder"],"Payment Frequency":["Betalingsfrekvens"],"Last Payment Due":["Sidste betaling forfalder"],"Total Interest Due":["Renter i alt"],"Total All Payments":["Alle betalinger i alt"],"Auto Loan Payment Schedule":["Betalingsplan for bill\u00e5n"],"Year":["\u00c5r"],"Date":["Dato"],"Payment":["Afdrag"],"Interest":["Rente"],"Principal":["Hovedstol"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Beregningsmetode: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Hovedstol i alt"],"Total Interest":["Renter i alt"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Pct. af de samlede betalinger"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["\u00c5rlige hovedstols- og rentebel\u00f8b i alt"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Akkumuleret hovedstol og renter med restsaldo"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Hovedstol og renter i alt"],"Loan":["L\u00e5n"],"One of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment Amount\" or \"Loan Amount\" must be \"0\".":["En af f\u00f8lgende: \"Pris\", \"Udbetalingsbel\u00f8b\" eller \"L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b\" skal v\u00e6re \"0\"."],"You may use our general purpose loan calculator if you don't want to consider purchase price.":["Du kan bruge vores l\u00e5neberegner til generelle form\u00e5l, hvis du ikke \u00f8nsker at tage hensyn til k\u00f8bsprisen."],"Only one of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment\" or \"Loan Amount\" can be \"0\".":["Kun \u00e9n af f\u00f8lgende: \"Pris\", \"Udbetaling\" eller \"L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b\" kan v\u00e6re \"0\"."],"There are too many unknown values.":["Der er for mange ukendte v\u00e6rdier."],"Auto Loan Calculator Help":["Hj\u00e6lp til bill\u00e5nberegner"],"<p>Use this calculator to calculate loan details when the down payment is expressed as an amount.<\/p>":["<p>Brug denne beregner til at beregne l\u00e5nedetaljer, n\u00e5r udbetalingen er angivet som et bel\u00f8b.<\/p>"],"<p>Unlike a general loan calculator, this calculator allows for two unknown values. In addition to solving for the monthly payment amount, it will also calculate the \"Car Price\", the \"Down Payment Amount\" or the \"Loan Amount\". Just enter a \"0\" (zero) for one of the three values and provide the other two.<\/p>":["<p>I mods\u00e6tning til en almindelig l\u00e5neberegner giver denne beregner mulighed for to ukendte v\u00e6rdier. Udover at beregne det m\u00e5nedlige betalingsbel\u00f8b vil den ogs\u00e5 beregne \"Bilpris\", \"Udbetalingsbel\u00f8b\" eller \"L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b\". Indtast blot en \"0\" (nul) for en af de tre v\u00e6rdier og angiv de to andre.<\/p>"],"<p>Note that the calculator calculates what percentage the down payment is of the price of the car. This is handy when a lender requires a borrower to provide a minimum percentage cash deposit.<\/p>":["<p>Bem\u00e6rk, at beregneren udregner, hvor stor en procentdel udbetalingen udg\u00f8r af bilens pris. Dette er nyttigt, n\u00e5r en l\u00e5ngiver kr\u00e6ver, at l\u00e5ntageren stiller et minimumsbel\u00f8b i kontant depositum.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">L\u00e5nets l\u00f8betid er angivet som et antal m\u00e5neder.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 m\u00e5neder = &nbsp;5 \u00e5r<\/li><li>120 m\u00e5neder = 10 \u00e5r<\/li><li>180 m\u00e5neder = 15 \u00e5r<\/li><li>240 m\u00e5neder = 20 \u00e5r<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 m\u00e5neder = 30 \u00e5r<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need the ability to print the amortization schedule, or more flexibility such as selecting different payment or compounding frequencies or the ability to calculate term or interest rate, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Hvis du har brug for muligheden for at udskrive amortiseringsplanen eller mere fleksibilitet som at v\u00e6lge forskellige betalings- eller rentesammens\u00e6tningsfrekvenser eller muligheden for at beregne l\u00f8betid eller rente, se venligst bilberegneren her: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you want to set the loan closing date and first payment due date; select different payment or compounding frequencies; the ability to calculate term or interest rate; or the ability to export the schedule to Excel or Word, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Hvis du vil indstille l\u00e5nets afslutningsdato og f\u00f8rste betalingsdato; v\u00e6lge forskellige betalings- eller rentesamlingsfrekvenser; muligheden for at beregne l\u00f8betid eller rentesats; eller muligheden for at eksportere planen til Excel eller Word, se venligst bill\u00e5nberegneren her: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Monthly":["M\u00e5nedlig"],"Your Personalized Car Loan Schedule":["Din personlige bill\u00e5neplan"],"Prepared for":["Forberedt til"],"Address":["Adresse"],"City, State  ZIP":["By, Region, Postnummer"],"Prepared On":["Forberedt den"],"Prepared by":["Forberederens navn"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Hjemmeside"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Brug venligst backspace-tasten til at slette."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Piletasterne til venstre, op og ned er deaktiveret. Det samme g\u00e6lder tasterne home, end, pgup og pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Brug backspace for at slette."],"Unknown":["Ukendt"],"u":["u"],"U":["U"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datoer skal v\u00e6re den f\u00f8rste i m\u00e5neden."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Et ugyldigt JavaScript-datoobjekt."]}}}